     4	
     5	/**
     6	 * The Figma colour cascade is the part of this recipe that can break without surfacing as a
     7	 * type or build error — a mis-ordered branch renders a plausible-but-wrong border. These
     8	 * assertions moved here from useZimmTextInputState.test.ts when the derivation moved out of
