26	
27	**Fonts are self-hosted and served on every tier.** `overrides/app/static/fonts/` holds two
28	Futura Round faces — Regular 400 and Medium 500 — declared by
29	`overrides/app/theme/fontFace.tsx` and mounted in both `_app-config/index.tsx` and
30	`.storybook/preview.tsx`. Only two faces exist because only two are used: all 22 textStyles
31	resolve to fontWeight 400 or 500, and `fonts.body === fonts.heading`.
32	
33	There is **no environment gate** on this, and it is worth stating plainly because an earlier
34	revision of this section claimed there was. `ZimmFontFace` mounts unconditionally inside
35	`_app-config`'s `ChakraProvider`, and `pwa-kit-dev`'s `staticFolderCopyPlugin` copies
36	`overrides/app/static` in both the client and SSR webpack configs — so the `.woff2` are
37	published with every bundle and shoppers on every storefront render Futura Round.
38	
39	`foundation/fonts.ts` already lists `'Futura Round'` first in both stacks, so the `@font-face`
40	declaration is the only thing that makes it resolve — no component, recipe or token changes.
41	The fallback stack renders roughly 13% wider, which is why serving the real faces matters for
42	design-parity review against Figma.
43	
44	Per-component theme overrides live in `overrides/app/theme/components/` and are
45	**Tier 2** — see [protectedFiles.md](./protectedFiles.md). `overrides/app/theme/globalStyles.ts`
46	is also **Tier 2** — it composes the `.zimm-*` global class registry from the `--zimm-*`
47	variables defined in `foundation/zimmTokens.ts`, so it is derived styling rather than a
48	brand token source, but it emits CSS on every page and therefore needs a named owner.
49	
50	## Commerce SDK Hooks (Owner: Integration / SI Partner — #integration)

